// TypeScript project for this member: extends exactly one @stackra/typescript-config preset and sets nothing else
// (pnpm validate checks the preset). tsc reads tsconfig.json as JSONC, so the name stays .json.
// `decorators`: ports, types, enums, functions and refusals; no TSX and no decorators of its own. `atob` comes from
// @types/node.
// The sources it typechecks through `@stackra/source` (@stackra/config, @stackra/validation, @stackra/errors) carry legacy field
// decorators (ADR 0005), so tsc needs `experimentalDecorators` here as the vitest preset already has it.
// Owner: release-operations · Secrets: forbidden
{ "extends": "@stackra/typescript-config/decorators" }
